"DolocTown.UI.SplashController","GetThanksText","System.String DolocTown.UI.SplashController::GetThanksText(System.String)","IL_0017","547","
Dear Scavengers, <color=#20AB8B>Doloc Town</color> is officially live in Early Access! The team would like to thank everyone for your support and love along the way. Now, it's time to grab your gear and dive into the wild. We hope you enjoy the adventure!
If you have any feedback or suggestions, please reach out to us at <color=#DF8235>qa@logoi.net</color> - we'd love to hear from you.
Want to stay updated? Join our Discord or follow us on X (<color=#4682B4>@RedSawGames</color>) for the latest news.
Thanks again, and happy scavenging!
"
"DolocTown.UI.SplashController","GetWarningText","System.String DolocTown.UI.SplashController::GetWarningText(System.String)","IL_0001","7","warning"
"DolocTown.UI.SplashController","GetWarningText","System.String DolocTown.UI.SplashController::GetWarningText(System.String)","IL_0017","403","
<size=48><align=center><color=#E05290>Warning: Read Before Playing</color></align></size>
Some flashing lights or visual effects in this game may trigger discomfort in individuals who are photosensitive, have epilepsy, or experience similar conditions. If you experience any symptoms such as eye pain, headaches, or blurred vision, please stop playing and rest.
Thank you for playing and have fun!
"
